## #4471: Two Distinct Problems

The 427 reports in this merged ticket belong to two separate causes:

### Problem 1: Parser (414 reports)
Date parser reads MM/DD regardless of locale, causing day/month swaps for day-first locales.

**GitHub Issue:** https://github.com/piotrczarnak/mega/issues/22

### Problem 2: Hint (13 reports)
booking-v3 form shows MM/DD hint, misleading day-first locale users into swapping day and month.

**GitHub Issue:** https://github.com/piotrczarnak/mega/issues/23

